            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-1528",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "undici: undici: Denial of Service via crafted WebSocket frame with large length"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "ImpactA server can reply with a WebSocket frame using the 64-bit length form and an extremely large length. undici's ByteParser overflows internal math, ends up in an invalid state, and throws a fatal TypeError that terminates the process.\n\nPatches\n\nPatched in the undici version v7.24.0 and v6.24.0. Users should upgrade to this version or later."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-1528",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-1528\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: undici\nFixed Version: 6.24.0, 7.24.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-1528](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-1528)\nImpactA server can reply with a WebSocket frame using the 64-bit length form and an extremely large length. undici's ByteParser overflows internal math, ends up in an invalid state, and throws a fatal TypeError that terminates the process.\n\nPatches\n\nPatched in the undici version v7.24.0 and v6.24.0. Users should upgrade to this version or later.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-1528**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|undici|6.24.0, 7.24.0|[CVE-2026-1528](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-1528)|\n\nImpactA server can reply with a WebSocket frame using the 64-bit length form and an extremely large length. undici's ByteParser overflows internal math, ends up in an invalid state, and throws a fatal TypeError that terminates the process.\n\nPatches\n\nPatched in the undici version v7.24.0 and v6.24.0. Users should upgrade to this version or later."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 7.5,
                "cvssv3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H",
